  "method": "4 tabs x 2 PowerShell panes, 3 cycles, 22s concurrent output plus 5000 lines per pane per cycle; 250ms tab switching and 1s resizing for 20s; wait through 60s undo-close retention; 4096x4096 PNG decoded to 2048x2048.",
